Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 01:19:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] display: add an outdoor mode toggle under brightness

outdoor mode only lives in the livedisplay page, which has no entry
in settings, so there is no way to reach it.

add a switch to the brightness category that sets the livedisplay
mode to outdoor or off.
---
 AndroidManifest.xml                           |  1 +
 res/values/outdoor_mode_strings.xml           |  9 ++++
 res/xml/display_settings.xml                  |  7 +++
 .../OutdoorModePreferenceController.java      | 47 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 64 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 res/values/outdoor_mode_strings.xml
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/display/OutdoorModePreferenceController.java

